## Acceptance Criteria

| # | Target | Met |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | The site module polls a ticker every five minutes | [ ] |

## Design

`bin/aic make poller site Ticker` writes the job and its service and adds the job and its schedule to the manifest.

### File Manifest

| File | Change | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `modules/site/src/Job/TickerPoll.php` | create | The job |
| `modules/site/src/Service/TickerPoller.php` | create | The service it asks |
| `modules/site/site.module.php` | modify | The job and its schedule |

### Locked-In Decisions

1. The poller scaffold makes both classes.

